{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/cycles\/directedsimplecycles"]}],"metadata":{"title":"DirectedSimpleCycles","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DirectedSimpleCycles","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Cycles"}],"externalID":"s:6Cycles014DirectedSimpleA0V","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DirectedSimpleCycles","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Cycles\/SimpleCycles.swift#L14","fileName":"SimpleCycles.swift"}},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Every simple cycle of a directed graph once, lazily: by least vertex (in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"text":" order),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and among the cycles with one least vertex in the order a depth-first search from it, taking","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"out-edges in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"outEdges"},{"text":" order, meets them.","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Cycles\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Cycles\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Cycles\/ST"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DirectedSimpleCycles","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P","text":"DirectedGraph","identifier":"doc:\/